<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Financial Aid Verification Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  .section-header {
    border-top: 2px solid #000;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
    padding: 10px 0;
    margin: 20px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .form-row {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .label-col {
    width: 30%;
  }
  .input-col {
    width: 70%;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <div style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold;">UNIVERSITY OF</div>
      <div style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold;">South Carolina</div>
      <div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;">PALMETTO COLLEGE</div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h2 style="margin: 0;">Financial Aid Offices</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0;">Lancaster, Salkehatchie, Sumter, Union</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <h1 style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0 20px 0;">2022-2023 DEPENDENT VERIFICATION FORM</h1>
  <p>Your application was selected for a review process called <span data-field="verification_status">{{ verification_status }}</span>. The law says that before awarding Federal Student Aid, we may ask you to confirm the information that you and your parents reported on your FAFSA. If there are differences between the two, we may need to correct your FAFSA information. <span data-field="cannot_continue_warning">{{ cannot_continue_warning }}</span></p>

  <div class="section-header">
    SECTION A: STUDENT INFORMATION
  </div>

  <p>Print the information requested below:</p>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Student's Name</div>
    <div class="input-col"><span data-field="student_full_name">{{ student_full_name }}</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">VIP ID</div>
    <div class="input-col"><span data-field="vip_id">{{ vip_id }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">
    SECTION B: HOUSEHOLD INFORMATION
  </div>

  <p>Print the information requested below: <span data-field="do_not_leave_blank">{{ do_not_leave_blank }}</span></p>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Parent(s) current marital status:</div>
    <div class="input-col" style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Never Married</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Married/Remarried</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Divorced/Separated</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Widowed</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Unmarried and both legal parents living together</label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label-col">Month and year your parent(s) were married/remarried, separated, divorced, or widowed:</div>
    <div class="input-col"><span data-field="marital_status_date">{{ marital_status_date }}</span></div>
  </div>

  <p>List all family members to include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>You/self</li>
    <li>Your parent(s) (including stepparents)</li>
    <li>Your parent(s) other dependent children if a) your parent(s) will provide more than half of their support from July 1, 2022 through June 30, 2023, or b) the children would be required to provide parental information when applying for Federal Student Aid</li>
    <li>Other people only if they now live in your parent(s) household and your parent(s) will provide more than half of their support from July 1, 2022 through June 30, 2023</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Include the name of the college for any household member, excluding your parent(s), who will be enrolled at least half-time between July 1, 2022 through June 30, 2023.</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;">Full Name</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Date of Birth</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Relationship to Student</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Attending College in 2022-2023?</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">If Attending College in 2022-2023, Name of College (exclude parents)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for i in range(1, 9) %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="household_member_name[{{ i-1 }}]">{{ household_member_name[i-1] }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="household_member_dob[{{ i-1 }}]">{{ household_member_dob[i-1] }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="household_member_relationship[{{ i-1 }}]">{{ household_member_relationship[i-1] }}</span></td>
        <td>
          <label><input type="radio" name="college_status_{{ i }}" value="yes"> Yes</label>
          <label><input type="radio" name="college_status_{{ i }}" value="no"> No</label>
        </td>
        <td><span data-field="household_member_college[{{ i-1 }}]">{{ household_member_college[i-1] }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-header">
    SECTION C: INCOME INFORMATION
  </div>

  <h3>Acceptable Documentation to Verify Income</h3>
  <p>IRS Tax Return submit signed copy of completed tax return</p>
  <p>Tax return transcripts can be requested online at <span data-field="irs_transcript_link">{{ irs_transcript_link }}</span> or by calling 1-800-908-9946</p>
  <p>W-2s must be submitted to verify income from work</p>
  <p>Non Filing Letter must request a Verification of Non-Filing Letter "Get Transcript Online" tool at <span data-field="non_filing_link">{{ non_filing_link }}</span> or by submitting IRS Form 4506-T and checking box 7</p>

  <div class="form-row">
    <p>1. Did you (the student) file a 2020 IRS Income Tax Return? (Check one)</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <label><input type="radio" name="student_filed_2020_tax" value="yes"> YES</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="student_filed_2020_tax" value="no"> NO</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <p>Check here if you used the IRS Data Retrieval Tool (DRT) through FAFSA</p>
    <p>Check here if you attached a copy of your 2020 IRS Tax Return OR 2020 IRS Tax Return Transcript. You must also provide all applicable tax schedules.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <p>Complete the section below if you will not file AND are not required to file a 2020 Federal Tax Return.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <p>Check one:</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <label><input type="radio" name="no_tax_return_filed" value="student_not_employed"> The student was not employed and had no income from work earned in 2020.</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="no_tax_return_filed" value="student_not_required_to_file"> The student was not required to file but earned some income in 2020. Below list the name(s) of the employer(s), the amount earned and attach all of your 2020 W-2's.</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <p>Employer's Name</p>
    <p>Amount of 2019 Income</p>
    <p>IRS W-2 Attached?</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 33%;">Employer's Name</th>
          <th style="width: 33%;">Amount of 2019 Income</th>
          <th style="width: 33%;">IRS W-2 Attached?</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="employer_name_2019">{{ employer_name_2019 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="amount_2019_income">{{ amount_2019_income }}</span></td>
          <td>
            <label><input type="radio" name="w2_attached_2019" value="yes"> Yes</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="w2_attached_2019" value="no"> No</label>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <p>2. Did your FAFSA parent(s) file a 2020 IRS Income Tax Return? (Check one)</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <label><input type="radio" name="parent_filed_2020_tax" value="yes"> YES</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="parent_filed_2020_tax" value="no"> NO</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <p>Check here if your FAFSA parent(s) used the IRS Data Retrieval Tool (DRT) through FAFSA</p>
    <p>Check here if your FAFSA parent(s) attached a copy of their 2020 IRS Tax Return OR 2020 IRS Tax Return Transcript. You must also provide all applicable tax schedules.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <p>Complete this section if your FAFSA parent(s) will not file AND are not required to file a 2020 Federal Tax Return. Confirmation of the non-filing status is REQUIRED from the IRS using Form 4506-T.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <p>Check one:</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <label><input type="radio" name="parent_no_tax_return_filed" value="parent_not_employed"> The FAFSA parent(s) was not employed and had no income from work earned in 2020.</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="parent_not_required_to_file" value="parent_not_required_to_file"> The FAFSA parent(s) was not required to file but earned some income in 2020. Below list the name(s) of the employer(s), the amount earned and attach all of your 2020 W-2's.</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <p>Employer's Name</p>
    <p>Amount of 2020 Income</p>
    <p>IRS W-2 Attached?</p>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 33%;">Employer's Name</th>
          <th style="width: 33%;">Amount of 2020 Income</th>
          <th style="width: 33%;">IRS W-2 Attached?</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="employer_name_2020">{{ employer_name_2020 }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="amount_2020_income">{{ amount_2020_income }}</span></td>
          <td>
            <label><input type="radio" name="w2_attached_2020" value="yes"> Yes</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="w2_attached_2020" value="no"> No</label>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-header">
    SECTION D: CERTIFICATION STATEMENT & SIGNATURES
  </div>

  <p>By signing this document, I certify that all the information reported on it is complete and correct. I if purposely give false or misleading information on it, will be cause for denial or repayment of financial aid and I may also be fined, sentenced to jail, or both.</p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>Student</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 40px;"><span data-field="student_signature_line">{{ student_signature_line }}</span></p>
      <p>Date</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><span data-field="student_date">{{ student_date }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
      <p>Parent</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 40px;"><span data-field="parent_signature_line">{{ parent_signature_line }}</span></p>
      <p>Date</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 10px;"><span data-field="parent_date">{{ parent_date }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #000;">
    <p style="font-size: 12px;">Return signed completed form and all requested documents to:</p>
    <p style="font-size: 12px;">Financial Aid Office - The address for specific campus can be found online at: <span data-field="office_address_link">{{ office_address_link }}</span></p>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>